WinDuo is a Windows port of Mac Duo's lid-close depth effect. The following
parts are ports of Mac Duo's implementation rather than independent work, and
each carries a note saying so in its source file:

    winduo/effect/homography.py   from Homography.swift
    winduo/effect/geometry.py     from DepthGeometry in DepthOverlay.swift
    winduo/effect/spring.py       from CriticallyDampedSpring.swift
    winduo/effect/gradient.py     from BlurGradient.swift
    winduo/effect/controller.py   from LidController.swift
    winduo/render/shaders.py      from DepthShaders.swift
    winduo/render/overlay.py      structure from DepthOverlay.swift and
                                  DepthRenderer.swift

The angle estimation in winduo/angle/ is not derived from Mac Duo. Mac Duo reads
a hardware lid angle sensor over HID; that code has no counterpart here.
